patrone-unpack (0.1.4) resolute; urgency=medium

  * A Flatpak too, for any Linux (flatpak/org.patrone.Unpack.yml,
    tools/build-flatpak.sh); each release has the bundle, and Patrone's
    app index lists it. In the Flatpak, the programs it runs for packages
    are the computer's (flatpak-spawn --host), and it says a .deb package
    needs its own package to install, in place of an Install button.
  * An AppStream listing (org.patrone.Unpack.metainfo.xml), for GNOME
    Software and the app index.

 -- William Daugherty <31995458+billsecond@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 09:00:00 -0600

